{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Calico Falls is a piece of ",["l","家具","furniture"]," that hangs on a wall. It can rotate into daily stock at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," for 750g or the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for between 250–2,500g."]],["p",["It's also available from the ",["l","家具目录","Furniture Catalogue"]," for 0g."]],["p",["Calico Falls is used as the icon for the ",["l","收集包#Specialty Fish Bundle","Specialty Fish Bundle"]," in the ",["l","收集包#Fish Tank","Fish Tank"]," inside the ",["l","社区中心","Community Center"],"."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Introduced."]]]]]]]}